# pool: nature
# title: Korean nature: animals, plants, seafood and seasons | 자연·동식물
# category: nature
# source: Korean names follow the National Institute of Biological Resources species list (species.nibr.go.kr); Natural Monument designations from the Korea Heritage Service (heritage.go.kr); the 24 solar terms per the Korea Astronomy and Space Science Institute. Editorial selection of common and notable species.
# drafted: 2026-10-11, AI-assisted
# reviewed: pending
# name | hangul | fam | tags | aliases | note
# "monument" marks species designated as Natural Monuments (cheonnyeon ginyeommul); "endemic" marks species found only on the Korean Peninsula.

